{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.6, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §8.3 (values by name, proposed as §5.12)"
  description: "response is typed type_kind, so its bare token is a type's name, one segment, and a dotted token is no type name. A value by name stands only where a bare token is not the positional field's value."
